You randomly merge with an adjacent bloated ooze, granting you 40% all damage resistance for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

This process releases a burst of antimagic, dealing [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Manaburn damage in radius 3.

This talent allows you to restore [0.9, 1.1, 1.3, 1.5, 1.6 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Equilibrium per turn while Mitosis is active.

The damage, duration and Equilibrium restoration increase with your Mindpower.
